"Modified Dataset" means any dataset, file, table, annotation, translation, subset, cleaned version, reformatted version, or other material created from the Dataset.

"Use" means downloading, reading, analyzing, processing, training models on, evaluating models on, or otherwise working with the Dataset.

"Redistribution" means sharing, uploading, publishing, selling, sublicensing, transferring, mirroring, hosting, or making the Dataset or a Modified Dataset available to any third party, whether publicly or privately, in whole or in part.

